{
    "title": "Numero: Travel eSIM & Numbers",
    "description": "<b> Ultimate communication solution in ONE DEVICE: Internet Plans, Phone Numbers, & Calls.</b> \r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#9F0044\">Constantly searching for the internet while traveling?</font></b>\r\nWith Numero: Access global internet plans while traveling.\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#9F0044\">Tired of managing multiple phone numbers and SIM cards?</font></b>\r\nWith Numero: Manage multiple phone numbers easily.\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#9F0044\">Worried about expensive international calls and roaming fees?</font></b>\r\nWith Numero: Make international calls at affordable rates.\r\n\r\n<b> WHY NUMERO?</b> \r\n\r\n<b> \ud83c\udf0d Stay Connected:</b> \r\nWhether traveling abroad or needing a local second phone number, Numero eSIM has you covered. Get a virtual SIM or virtual phone number for over 80 countries worldwide, allowing you to stay in touch with friends and family no matter where you are.\r\n\r\n<b> \ud83d\udeeb International Travel eSIM Made Easy:</b> \r\nForget about trying to find an internet connection when you\u2019re abroad. With Numero, you can get global eSIM data (travel eSIM) for over 190 countries. Enjoy smooth, seamless connectivity wherever you travel, and never stress about staying connected again. It's more affordable than traditional roaming, helping you save money while staying connected worldwide.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcb8 Win-Win Referral Program:</b> \r\nEarn free credit when your friends buy travel eSIMs through your referral link. They also get \u20ac3 discount on their purchases. You not only share rewards but also recommend a great travel solution for the travel community who is tired of paying for expensive international roaming.\r\nThis is ideal for digital nomads, group trips, or anyone looking to reduce their data spending. Everyone saves, and you earn rewards!\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udf10Local Calling Plans:</b> \r\nNumero eSIM understands the importance of saving money on international calls. That's why we offer local calling plans for over 20 countries. Having a virtual phone number as a 2nd phone number with a local calling package from Numero lets you make calls at local rates and save big on your international communication needs.\r\n\r\n<b> \ud83d\udcde Privacy at Your Fingertips: </b> \r\nProtect your privacy with Numero eSIM. Use a virtual phone number such as a USA number or a UK virtual number as a 2nd line for social media registrations or online services, You can also use a virtual number as a 2nd line for hotel check-ins, restaurant reservations, taxis, or anywhere you need a number while traveling, so your personal number stays private.\r\nWith a virtual phone number from Numero, especially [UK virtual number], keep your number private while using apps like WhatsApp, Telegram, and other messaging platforms. Enjoy the benefits of having a second phone number without compromising your privacy.\r\n\r\n<b> \ud83d\ude80 Perfect for Travelers:</b> \r\nIf you're traveling soon, or you are a frequent traveler, Numero eSIM offers local travel eSIM services, giving you a seamless experience without needing physical SIM cards. Get a local number, access internet plans (eSIM data), and enjoy calling minutes with your virtual SIM. Whether you need an international travel eSIM for your next trip, or a 2nd phone number to keep you connected, Numero ensures you roam freely, and never worry about finding a WiFi network again.\r\n\r\n<b> \ud83d\udcf2 Advanced Features:</b> \r\nNumero eSIM offers a range of advanced features to enhance your communication experience. Enjoy international WiFi calling at affordable prices, personalized voicemail on your virtual SIM or second phone number, call forwarding, and the ability to hide your 2nd phone number for private calls. Experience the convenience, privacy, and global connectivity of Numero eSIM. With Numero,  get a free USA number to use as a second phone number from the Free Coins Center in the App.\r\n\r\n<b> \ud83d\udcdd Flexible Plans:</b> \r\nChoose plans for 1 month, 3 months, or 1 year, with auto-renewal ON by default. Sign up with your GSM number and start using Numero!\r\n\r\nContact Us:\r\nEmail: support@numeroesim.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b> Ultimate communication solution in ONE DEVICE: Internet Plans, Phone Numbers, &amp; Calls.</b> <br><br><b><font color=\"#9F0044\">Constantly searching for the internet while traveling?</font></b><br>With Numero: Access global internet plans while traveling.<br><br><b><font color=\"#9F0044\">Tired of managing multiple phone numbers and SIM cards?</font></b><br>With Numero: Manage multiple phone numbers easily.<br><br><b><font color=\"#9F0044\">Worried about expensive international calls and roaming fees?</font></b><br>With Numero: Make international calls at affordable rates.<br><br><b> WHY NUMERO?</b> <br><br><b> \ud83c\udf0d Stay Connected:</b> <br>Whether traveling abroad or needing a local second phone number, Numero eSIM has you covered. Get a virtual SIM or virtual phone number for over 80 countries worldwide, allowing you to stay in touch with friends and family no matter where you are.<br><br><b> \ud83d\udeeb International Travel eSIM Made Easy:</b> <br>Forget about trying to find an internet connection when you\u2019re abroad. With Numero, you can get global eSIM data (travel eSIM) for over 190 countries. Enjoy smooth, seamless connectivity wherever you travel, and never stress about staying connected again. It&#39;s more affordable than traditional roaming, helping you save money while staying connected worldwide.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udcb8 Win-Win Referral Program:</b> <br>Earn free credit when your friends buy travel eSIMs through your referral link. They also get \u20ac3 discount on their purchases. You not only share rewards but also recommend a great travel solution for the travel community who is tired of paying for expensive international roaming.<br>This is ideal for digital nomads, group trips, or anyone looking to reduce their data spending. Everyone saves, and you earn rewards!<br><br><b>\ud83c\udf10Local Calling Plans:</b> <br>Numero eSIM understands the importance of saving money on international calls. That&#39;s why we offer local calling plans for over 20 countries. Having a virtual phone number as a 2nd phone number with a local calling package from Numero lets you make calls at local rates and save big on your international communication needs.<br><br><b> \ud83d\udcde Privacy at Your Fingertips: </b> <br>Protect your privacy with Numero eSIM. Use a virtual phone number such as a USA number or a UK virtual number as a 2nd line for social media registrations or online services, You can also use a virtual number as a 2nd line for hotel check-ins, restaurant reservations, taxis, or anywhere you need a number while traveling, so your personal number stays private.<br>With a virtual phone number from Numero, especially [UK virtual number], keep your number private while using apps like WhatsApp, Telegram, and other messaging platforms. Enjoy the benefits of having a second phone number without compromising your privacy.<br><br><b> \ud83d\ude80 Perfect for Travelers:</b> <br>If you&#39;re traveling soon, or you are a frequent traveler, Numero eSIM offers local travel eSIM services, giving you a seamless experience without needing physical SIM cards. Get a local number, access internet plans (eSIM data), and enjoy calling minutes with your virtual SIM. Whether you need an international travel eSIM for your next trip, or a 2nd phone number to keep you connected, Numero ensures you roam freely, and never worry about finding a WiFi network again.<br><br><b> \ud83d\udcf2 Advanced Features:</b> <br>Numero eSIM offers a range of advanced features to enhance your communication experience. Enjoy international WiFi calling at affordable prices, personalized voicemail on your virtual SIM or second phone number, call forwarding, and the ability to hide your 2nd phone number for private calls. Experience the convenience, privacy, and global connectivity of Numero eSIM. With Numero,  get a free USA number to use as a second phone number from the Free Coins Center in the App.<br><br><b> \ud83d\udcdd Flexible Plans:</b> <br>Choose plans for 1 month, 3 months, or 1 year, with auto-renewal ON by default. Sign up with your GSM number and start using Numero!<br><br>Contact Us:<br>Email: support@numeroesim.com",
